WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.512 --> 00:00:04.836
- Basketball at Winnebago is
one of the biggest things here.

00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:07.790
A lot of these kids, that's
all they got is basketball.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:11.439
The town of Winnebago,
population's about 1500.

00:00:11.439 --> 00:00:16.022
The Winnebago Public
School is probably at 250.

00:00:16.022 --> 00:00:17.835
There ain't a whole lot to do here

00:00:17.835 --> 00:00:19.412
besides play basketball.

00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:22.433
Basically, all they got is a gym to go to.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.531
So, I opened it for 'em.

00:00:24.531 --> 00:00:27.114
(techno music)

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:31.916
(light piano music)

00:00:46.681 --> 00:00:48.669
When you come play for
Winnebago High School,

00:00:48.669 --> 00:00:52.836
we expect to compete every
year for a state title.

00:00:54.103 --> 00:00:55.640
My name is Jeffrey Berridge,

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.139
and I am the head coach at
Winnebago Public School.

00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:01.154
Winter's in Winnebago, it's
cold but everybody knows

00:01:01.154 --> 00:01:04.278
it's basketball season, so
that means the gym's hot.

00:01:04.278 --> 00:01:06.370
It's goin’, and they love it.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:08.619
Basketball here is really big.

00:01:08.619 --> 00:01:09.758
It plays an important part

00:01:09.758 --> 00:01:12.613
in our community of Native Americans.

00:01:12.613 --> 00:01:14.119
Rezball is just our version

00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:17.627
of a really fast-paced basketball game.

00:01:17.627 --> 00:01:19.231
We call it Rezball.

00:01:19.231 --> 00:01:21.181
It's comin' from the
Reservation, obviously,

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.423
it's a short for Rez.

00:01:22.423 --> 00:01:24.673
If you miss a shot, you miss a shot.

00:01:24.673 --> 00:01:25.506
Move on.

00:01:25.506 --> 00:01:26.339
- Yeah, I got it.

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:28.385
- [Jeffrey] I expect a lot from these boys,

00:01:28.385 --> 00:01:29.882
and I push them to be great.

00:01:29.882 --> 00:01:32.342
Because I don't just
wanna see them playing

00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:35.111
on this court, I wanna
go watch them in college.

00:01:35.111 --> 00:01:37.151
That's my ultimate goal
is just to get these kids

00:01:37.151 --> 00:01:38.644
to bigger places.

00:01:38.644 --> 00:01:39.911
- [Crowd] Defense!

00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:40.744
Defense!

00:01:42.065 --> 00:01:44.156
(piano music)

00:01:44.156 --> 00:01:46.645
- [Jeffrey] Some of
these kids have it hard.

00:01:46.645 --> 00:01:49.195
Broken homes, alcohol, gambling,

00:01:49.195 --> 00:01:52.479
all that stuff comes into
play on the Reservations.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.097
And basketball does save them.

00:01:54.097 --> 00:01:55.937
I always tell 'em, "You
take care of that ball,

00:01:55.937 --> 00:01:57.621
"that ball's gonna take care of you."

00:01:57.621 --> 00:01:59.121
- You got knock down open shot.

00:01:59.121 --> 00:02:00.419
Knock down open shot.

00:02:00.419 --> 00:02:01.879
- [Jeffrey] And I'm walkin' proof of it.

00:02:01.879 --> 00:02:05.504
I'm from here, I played
ball at the college level,

00:02:05.504 --> 00:02:07.260
and it's just what I bring to these kids

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.418
and show them that it's possible.

00:02:10.418 --> 00:02:13.393
D'von Lapointe, he's
a senior guard for me,

00:02:13.393 --> 00:02:16.348
so this year he's probably
the best player on the team.

00:02:16.348 --> 00:02:19.516
Everything's gonna go through him.

00:02:19.516 --> 00:02:22.404
- [D'von] Basketball, it's my medicine.

00:02:22.404 --> 00:02:24.986
Just helps me get away from my problems

00:02:24.986 --> 00:02:25.859
for a little bit.

00:02:25.859 --> 00:02:28.050
(crowd cheering)

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.411
It's our stress reliever.

00:02:29.411 --> 00:02:31.664
Just play basketball.

00:02:31.664 --> 00:02:33.200
When I put that jersey on,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.534
I try to carry the
tradition for the people

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.116
that already built it.

00:02:37.116 --> 00:02:40.121
We're just tryin' to
keep this legacy goin'.

00:02:40.121 --> 00:02:41.453
- Alright, so let's go out there

00:02:41.453 --> 00:02:44.085
and let's have some fun
and give these guys a show.

00:02:44.085 --> 00:02:45.001
- On three!

00:02:45.001 --> 00:02:46.176
- One, two, three!

00:02:46.176 --> 00:02:48.669
(crowd cheering)

00:02:48.669 --> 00:02:52.682
- The fans of Winnebago,
really, it gets crazy.

00:02:52.682 --> 00:02:55.560
They're loud, they're yelling.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.472
I mean, it's just, it's
a great atmosphere.

00:02:57.472 --> 00:02:59.725
(crowd cheering)

00:02:59.725 --> 00:03:02.434
The fans come to watch because they see

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:05.818
how hard the boys work on the court.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.651
Winnebago is a very special place.

